  "scenario": "Run the same fixed-size Qt Quick Vulkan window for 60 measured seconds per setting on stock Plasma Wayland. Set KWIN_DRM_OVERRIDE_SAFETY_MARGIN to 10000 and then 1000 for KWin. Observe the whole HDMI CRTC independently through DRM WAIT_VBLANK and GETCRTC.",
  "expected": "Assess whether the 1000 microsecond setting increases both Qt swap rate and CRTC framebuffer change rate.",
  "observed": "The 1000 microsecond setting reduced Qt swaps from 44.80 to 28.88 per second and CRTC framebuffer changes from 31.330 to 28.659 per second. Both CRTC windows covered 2000 consecutive vblank intervals.",
